<v Clevins Browne>I was basically just isolated to where I was at, just on my block. That's where I was at every day. Didn't really have any desire to go anywhere, really.
<v Clevins Browne>我基本上被隔离在我所在的地方，就在我的街区。我每天都在那儿。真的没怎么有去任何地方的欲望。

