00:31:44.210 --> 00:31:45.980
<v Sarah Koenig>And so did you?
<v Sarah Koenig>那你取了吗？

00:31:45.980 --> 00:31:50.040
<v Clevins Browne>Mm-hmm. As much as I could. I didn't grab every last one, but I grabbed as much as I can.
